    "fieldfare": {
      "word": "FIELDFARE",
      "definitions": [
        {
          "text": "a small thrush (Turdus pilaris) which breeds in northern Europe and winters in Great Britain. The head, nape, and lower part of the back are ash-colored; the upper part of the back and wing coverts, chestnut; -- called also fellfare.",
